sequenceDiagram
    participant U as Usuario WhatsApp
    participant M as Meta Cloud API
    participant GW as Gateway FastAPI
    participant C as Cache Redis
    participant AG as Agent Gemini
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    U->>M: Que propone Keiko en educacion?
    M->>GW: POST /webhook + X-Hub-Signature-256

    Note over GW: HMAC verify < 1ms
    Note over GW: Rate limit check < 2ms
    Note over GW: Phone validate < 1ms
    Note over GW: LLM Guard input < 10ms

    GW->>C: Exact cache lookup < 2ms

    alt Cache HIT
        C-->>GW: Respuesta cacheada
    else Cache MISS
        GW->>C: Semantic cache < 50ms
        alt Semantic HIT similarity >= 0.92
            C-->>GW: Respuesta similar
        else Full MISS
            GW->>C: Get session ultimos 20 msgs
            GW->>AG: Gemini generate + function calling
            AG->>DB: search_candidates Keiko educacion
            DB-->>AG: Propuestas de educacion
            AG-->>GW: Respuesta + fuentes
        end
    end

    Note over GW: Citation formatter
    Note over GW: Output scanner
    GW-->>M: Respuesta con citaciones
    M-->>U: Mensaje WhatsApp

    Note over GW: ASYNC: persist, session, cache
